{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》落選佳麗盧蔚晴卸下選美包袱後，於11月17日凌晨突然於社交平台大派震撼福利。她不僅現身 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《2026香港小姐競選》落選佳麗盧蔚晴卸下選美包袱後，於11月17日凌晨突然於社交平台大派震撼福利。她不僅現身中環夜店以火辣造型狂歡慶生，更驚喜發布一輯極具誘惑力性感兔女郎寫真。這位昔日風頭躉連環爆出震撼視覺畫面，背後真實意圖旋即引起全網高度關注。</p>\n<h2>盧蔚晴現身中環夜店火辣狂歡慶祝生日</h2>\n<p>盧蔚晴在社交網上載多段夜蒲短片，畫面中她現身中環夜店消遣兼慶祝生日。當晚她以一身極具衝擊力戰鬥格上陣，身穿黑色性感Tube Top配襯長褲，大方展露香肩與纖腰。在現場強勁音樂與迷離燈光交錯下，她與一眾友人玩得極之盡興，不僅在梳化上隨歌起舞，期間更開心舉起寫有「HAPPY BIRTHDAY DJ JASMINE」發光燈牌，現場氣氛被推至最高點。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598465392891_6608432846afc17811eba4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598465392891_6608432846afc17811eba4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>社交平台發布黑色兔女郎寫真震撼網民</h2>\n<p>除了夜蒲狂歡片段，盧蔚晴同時於社交平台發布另一輯極具誘惑力造型照作為回應粉絲支持。相片中她頭戴黑色兔耳頭飾，身穿掛頸開胸設計黑色緊身馬甲，胸前中門大開盡顯深邃事業線，下身則配搭型格鉚釘皮短褲，完美展現玲瓏浮凸驕人身材。她更對鏡頭做出轉身回眸及擺出誘人甫士，徹底打破過往參選時端莊形象，將狂野一面展露無遺。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598562533359_1875459496afc178222d60.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598562533359_1875459496afc178222d60.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178816993397757069_571316096a954ece73c32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 落選三甲（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178816993397757069_571316096a954ece73c32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>落選三甲（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598672746694_13031567226afc17832deb2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598672746694_13031567226afc17832deb2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949059877326075_15458629806afc17842c9cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949059877326075_15458629806afc17842c9cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598356535052_11366853936afc17800d0ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"985\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490598356535052_11366853936afc17800d0ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>昔日參選《2026香港小姐競選》大熱倒灶</h2>\n<p>回顧數個月前舉辦的《2026香港小姐競選》，盧蔚晴自報名參選以來一直憑藉出眾外形與高調作風成為傳媒焦點。當時外界普遍看好其奪冠潛力，惟最終未能打入前3名飲恨落選。雖然失落后冠，但她並未有因此淡出大眾視線，反而選擇以最真實姿態活躍於各大社交平台，頻繁分享多姿多采生活點滴，成功走出選美失利陰霾。</p>\n<h2>網民湧入社交帳號留言大讚身材無得輸</h2>\n<p>盧蔚晴連串破格動態曝光後，隨即吸引大批網民湧入其社交媒體點讚與關注。有粉絲在兔女郎照片下激動表示「嘩嘩嘩！原來扮兔女郎」，亦有人對其夜蒲造型給予高度評價，直指「好性感！冇得輸」。同時有不少留言認為她現時狀態遠比參選期間更加光芒四射，紛紛寫下「玩到跪地！太High」及「原來生日」等字句，社交平台互動量瞬間暴增。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178662747845828085_18011344106a7dc596b19cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178662747845828085_18011344106a7dc596b19cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178851483273574948_12894928596a9a9211164c2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧蔚晴 香港小姐 （圖片來源：IG@tiffanyl.o）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178851483273574948_12894928596a9a9211164c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@tiffanyl.o）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82%e6%96%b0%e8%81%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂新聞</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%9b%a7%e8%94%9a%e6%99%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">盧蔚晴</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港小姐</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：threads、TVB、IG@tiffanyl.o資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544768\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.429661+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1351,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:59:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:34.279423+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:34.279423+00:00","content_hash":"52a5b5655d7233768ca033837239d22b634615af9a83d661b6628eb9d9d6b558","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}